OL,3,GNEWSADriver tried to buy insurance
OL,4,Asitting in police car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug driver who had no insurance
OL,7,Ftried to cover his tracks by buying a
OL,8,Fpolicy sat in the back of a police car.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said Luke Hobley was
OL,11,Fstopped in a Ford Focus that was
OL,12,F"revving excessively" with a "loud
OL,13,Fpopping" exhaust in Grangewood Road,
OL,14,FChesterfield, on 1 December.
OL,16,FHobley, 29, of Hollis Lane in the town,
OL,17,Ffailed a roadside drugs test - carried
OL,18,Fout as police thought he smelt of
OL,19,Fcannabis - and bought temporary car
OL,20,Finsurance, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
