OL,3,GNEWSADriver tried to buy insurance
OL,4,Asitting in police car
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded guilty to drug driving and
OL,7,Fhaving no car insurance. He was banned
OL,8,Ffrom driving for 22 months when he was
OL,9,Fsentenced at Chesterfield Magistrates'
OL,10,FCourt on 28 August.
